        "max_bytes": 32,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "This message is to inform you that your <BR>registration with Global Cortex is now <BR>complete, welcome to the team Raven.": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 320,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "On the off-chance that it was not mentioned <BR>during the initial screening process, please<BR>allow me to briefly highlight a few aspects of <BR>exactly what it is Global Cortex does.": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 320,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "Our firm specializes in dispute resolution, the <BR>majority of which relates to corporate rivalry. <BR>We help fund and supply mercenaries such as <BR>yourself, and for a hefty fee, offer our clients <BR>access to this stable of ''mediators.''": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 320,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "As far as the Raven/client relationship is <BR>concerned, that is something we allow both <BR>parties to settle on by themselves. We do <BR>not force requests upon pilots, nor do we tell <BR>clients which pilots they have to employ.": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 320,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "This hands-off approach also extends to issues<BR>that may arise between a client and yourself.<BR>For all intensive purposes, Global Cortex's <BR>responsibilities end once you are locked into <BR>a mission contract.": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 320,
        "tipo": 3
    },
    "Services we do offer to those in our employ<BR>include; AC repairs, access to part uprgrades<BR>and ammunition stores, as well as limited<BR>mission update support. Costs are associated<BR>with most of these, so keep track of your credits.": {
        "traduccion": "",
        "max_bytes": 1600,
        "tipo": 3
    },
